-20T20:46:01+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with forty minutes of debate on H.R. 7283.", "date": "2026-07-20T20:40:30+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Considered under suspension of the rules. (consideration: CR H4656-4657; text: CR H4656)", "date": "2026-07-20T20:40:29+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Mr. Burlison moved to suspend the rules and pass the bill.", "date": "2026-07-20T20:40:08+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Ordered to be Reported (Amended) by the Yeas and Nays: 44 - 0.", "date": "2026-02-04T05:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Committee Consideration and Mark-up Session Held", "date": "2026-02-04T05:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Referred to the House Committee on Oversight and Government Reform.", "date": "2026-01-30T05:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": ["referral-committee"], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Introduced in House", "date": "2026-01-30T05:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": ["introduction"], "related_entities": []}], "sponsorships": [{"name": "James R. Walkinshaw", "classification": "cosponsor", "entity_type": "person", "primary": false, "person_id": "~{\"name\": \"James R. Walkinshaw\"}", "organization_id": null}, {"name": "Pat Fallon", "classification": "primary", "entity_type": "person", "primary": true, "person_id": "~{\"na